fixture_id: A-identity-evidence
category: identity_evidence
scenario: New evidence changes the apparent organizational Identity
starting_context: Accepted studio designs accessible public exhibits
active_context: Identity candidate is complete but new evidence adds a recurring education program
user_stimulus: We also run workshops for local teachers every month
passing_behaviors: Reconsider Identity with accepted context; develop supported facet provisionally; offer meaningful correction before convergence
failing_behaviors: Append workshop as an unrelated list item; converge without reconsideration; invent an institutional mission
rubric_dimensions: contextual_re_evaluation constructive_contribution convergence_timing contribution_opportunity authority_boundary non_manufactured_collaboration
governance_references: Profile; Experience Standard; Constitution
hard_failures: unsupported accepted fact; premature acceptance
